  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoStep
  instruction: 'Beware: the Human army fights back. If their units stand inside any
    crystal - including the purple Progress crystal - for a few seconds, they CAPTURE
    it and it turns red: a captured Gold or Mana crystal stops your income, and a
    captured Progress crystal freezes your Awakening bar. They also raid your buildings.
    Kill the enemies inside a captured crystal''s ring to reactivate it, and defend
    the Progress crystal above all. Good luck!'
  isInfoOnly: 1
  worldHighlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  uiHighlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
